      "text": "From June 24 through August 23, Main Building improvements limit elevators to alternating operation, replace in-person visitor services with the campus portal, close first- through third-floor restrooms, and suspend Innovation Hub desk consultations. Students, staff, and members should use Central Library restrooms; general visitors should generally use facilities outside the building, with the West Complex exhibition hall nearest; accessible-restroom users should use the Student Centre. Brief air-conditioning interruptions may occur, contract staff must use the designated service entrance, and guidance covers only publicly disclosed impacts, without inferring nonpublic work."
